#>wonder_agents_plans_curriculumlogicterminalmast_2
?["Does a spw subcommand run through runHeadlessCli emit ANSI escape sequences into outText, so Lab 1 can assert real CLI escapes?"]{
  #:depth #!computational // lens: capture probe
  ~#hypothesis: "only the init command writes escape sequences directly (init.ts defines green, bold and dim helpers); query, select and skim output is plain text"
  !probe{ "run runHeadlessCli for init --help, skim and query on one prompts file and count occurrences of the escape character in each outText; the result decides whether Lab 1 asserts on real CLI output or on a literal string" }
  $%[plan.commit_count, plan.phase_progress]
}
